abstract: >-
  A deliberately limited public record of selected concepts and evidence status
  within ArcTopia, an independent interdisciplinary research programme by
  Linda Thorstensen. Documented directions include future capability,
  decision-time verification, meaningful human control and transformation history.
  This record does not define the scope or hierarchy of the wider programme.
